  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICLEI -Local Government for Sustainability Africa- WaterSOURCE Project: Sharing Opportunities for Urban Resource Circularity &amp;Effiency</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">ICLEI- Local Government for Sustainability Africa- WaterSOURCE Project :Sharing  Opportunities for Urban Resource Circularity&amp;Efficiency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WaterSource project aims to address critical water governance challenges in South Africa, by strengthening local governance authorities(LGAs) and promoting sustainable service delivery through circular economy principles.By addressing critical inefficiencies in the water supply system and promoting equitable access, the initiative aligns with the priorities for FLC and South Africas constitutional rights to water</narrative>
